is part of pilot training.

225
00:16:04,572 --> 00:16:07,270
Look, he'll be back,
and probably really quick.

226
00:16:07,314 --> 00:16:09,142
Do you have somebody
out looking for him?

227
00:16:09,185 --> 00:16:11,057
It is not our responsibility

228
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:12,623
