229
00:16:12,667 --> 00:16:14,364
- Okay.
- But he is welcome to...

230
00:16:50,966 --> 00:16:52,881
Excuse me.

231
00:16:52,924 --> 00:16:55,362
Have you seen a kid
hanging out around here?

232
